{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  WHY WE MADE THIS SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Dynamic content section that displays brand story and FAQ content
  - Integrates with product collection metafields for dynamic content
  - Shows video, image, title, subtitle, and FAQ content
  - Conditional rendering based on metafield availability
  - Customizable styling with color schemes and background images
  - Responsive design with mobile/desktop optimizations
  - Uses collection metafields for content management
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  METAFIELD DATA EXTRACTION & VALIDATION
  =============================================================================
  Extracts and validates metafield data from product collections
  - Iterates through product.collections to find relevant metafields
  - Extracts title, subtitle, video, image, and FAQ content
  - Validates required fields before showing section
  - Uses custom metafields for content management
  - Breaks loop when first valid collection is found
{% endcomment %}
{% liquid
assign video = "" 
assign image = "" 
assign title_with_line_breaks = "" 
assign subtitle_with_line_breaks = "" 
assign faqs = "" 
assign show_section = false 

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  COLLECTION METAFIELD ITERATION
  =============================================================================
  Loops through product collections to find metafield content
  - product.collections: Array of collections containing the current product
  - collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_section_title: Required title metafield
  - Only processes collections with the required title metafield
  - Extracts all related metafield content from the first valid collection
{% endcomment %}
for collection in product.collections 
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    TITLE METAFIELD VALIDATION
    =============================================================================
    Checks for required section title metafield
    - wwmt_section_title: Required metafield for section display
    - newline_to_br: Converts line breaks to HTML br tags
    - title_with_line_breaks: Stores formatted title with line breaks
    - This is the primary requirement for section visibility
  {% endcomment %}
  if collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_section_title 
    assign title_with_line_breaks = collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_section_title | newline_to_br 
 
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      DEFAULT VIDEO METAFIELD EXTRACTION
      =============================================================================
      Extracts default video from collection metafields
      - wwmt_default_video: Video metafield for section display
      - video: Variable to store extracted video content
      - Used as background or featured video in the section
    {% endcomment %}
    if collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_default_video 
      assign video = collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_default_video 
    endif 
   
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      DEFAULT IMAGE METAFIELD EXTRACTION
      =============================================================================
      Extracts default image from collection metafields
      - wwmt_default_image: Image metafield for section display
      - image: Variable to store extracted image content
      - Used as background or featured image in the section
    {% endcomment %}
    if collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_default_image 
      assign image = collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_default_image 
    endif 
   
   
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      SUBTITLE METAFIELD EXTRACTION
      =============================================================================
      Extracts optional subtitle from collection metafields
      - wwmt_section_subtitle: Optional subtitle metafield
      - subtitle_with_line_breaks: Stores formatted subtitle with line breaks
      - newline_to_br: Converts line breaks to HTML br tags
    {% endcomment %}
    if collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_section_subtitle 
      assign subtitle_with_line_breaks = collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_section_subtitle | newline_to_br 
    endif 

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      FAQ METAFIELD EXTRACTION
      =============================================================================
      Extracts FAQ content from collection metafields
      - wwmt_fields: FAQ content metafield (rich text or list)
      - faqs: Variable to store extracted FAQ content
      - .value: Accesses the actual metafield value content
      - Used to display FAQ section below main content
    {% endcomment %}
    if collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_fields != blank 
      assign faqs = collection.metafields.custom.wwmt_fields.value 
    endif 

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      LOOP TERMINATION
      =============================================================================
      Breaks loop after finding first valid collection
      - Prevents processing multiple collections unnecessarily
      - Ensures consistent content from single collection
      - Optimizes performance by avoiding unnecessary iterations
    {% endcomment %}
    break 
  endif 
endfor 

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SECTION VISIBILITY VALIDATION
  =============================================================================
  Determines whether section should be displayed
  - title_with_line_breaks: Required title content
  - video: Required video content
  - subtitle_with_line_breaks: Required subtitle content
  - All three fields must be present for section to display
  - show_section: Boolean flag controlling section visibility
{% endcomment %}
if title_with_line_breaks != blank and video != blank and subtitle_with_line_breaks != blank  
  assign show_section = true    
endif
%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  CONDITIONAL SECTION RENDERING
  =============================================================================
  Only renders section when all required content is available
  - show_section: Boolean flag from metafield validation
  - Prevents empty section display
  - Ensures content quality and user experience
{% endcomment %}
{% if show_section %}
  
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    DYNAMIC STYLING & CUSTOMIZATION
    =============================================================================
    CSS styles for section appearance and responsive behavior
    - why-we-made-this: Base section styling class
    - Custom color schemes and background image support
    - Responsive padding and typography controls
    - Mobile-specific optimizations
  {% endcomment %}
  {% style %}
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      BASE SECTION STYLING
      =============================================================================
      Default spacing and layout for the section
      - padding-top/bottom: 4rem vertical spacing
      - margin-bottom: 8rem bottom margin for content separation
      - Provides consistent spacing across different content types
    {% endcomment %}
    .why-we-made-this {
      padding-top: 4rem;
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 8rem;
    }
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      CUSTOM COLOR SCHEME STYLING
      =============================================================================
      Dynamic color scheme based on theme editor settings
      - color_scheme: Theme color scheme selection (custom vs predefined)
      - color_bg: Custom background color when using custom scheme
      - color_text: Custom text color when using custom scheme
      - section-id-{{ section.id }}: Unique identifier for section-specific styling
    {% endcomment %}
    {% if section.settings.color_scheme == "custom" %}
      .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
        background: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
        --cust-text-color: {{ section.settings.color_text }};
      }

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        AUTO BUTTON STYLE HOVER EFFECTS
        =============================================================================
        Automatic button hover styling based on color scheme
        - button_style: 'auto' for automatic hover effects
        - Hover background: Uses text color as background
        - Hover text: Uses background color as text
        - Hover border: Uses background color for border
        - Creates high contrast hover states automatically
      {% endcomment %}
      {% if section.settings.button_style == 'auto' %}
        #section-id-{{ section.id }} .button:hover {
          background-color: {{ section.settings.color_text }};
          color: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
          border-color: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
        }
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      BACKGROUND IMAGE STYLING
      =============================================================================
      Custom background image with responsive behavior
      - bg_image: Background image from theme editor settings
      - background-attachment: fixed for parallax effect on desktop
      - background-size: cover for full coverage
      - background-repeat: no-repeat to prevent tiling
      - padding: 5rem for content spacing around background
    {% endcomment %}
    {% unless section.settings.bg_image == blank %}
      .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
        background-attachment: fixed;
        background-size: cover;
        background-repeat: no-repeat;
        padding: 5rem;
      }

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        LAZY LOADED BACKGROUND IMAGE
        =============================================================================
        Background image with lazy loading for performance
        - lazy-background: CSS class for lazy loading
        - background-image: Direct URL to high-resolution image
        - width: 2000: High-resolution image for all screen sizes
        - Ensures crisp display on high-DPI displays
      {% endcomment %}
      .section-id-{{ section.id }}.lazy-background {
        background-image: url("{{ section.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}");
      }

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        TEXT SHADOW FOR BACKGROUND IMAGES
        =============================================================================
        Text shadows for better readability over background images
        - h2: Heading text shadow for emphasis
        - p: Paragraph text shadow for readability
        - kansasnew: Custom serif font family
        - text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px with semi-transparent black
        - Ensures text remains readable over complex backgrounds
      {% endcomment %}
      #section-id-{{ section.id }} h2 {
        font-family: kansasnew,serif;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      }
      #section-id-{{ section.id }} p {
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      }

      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        MOBILE BACKGROUND IMAGE OPTIMIZATION
        =============================================================================
        Mobile-specific background image adjustments
        - max-width: 768px: Mobile breakpoint
        - padding: Reduced padding for mobile devices
        - background-attachment: initial to disable parallax on mobile
        - Prevents performance issues and improves mobile experience
      {% endcomment %}
      @media(max-width: 768px) {
          .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
            padding: 50px 0 0;
            background-attachment: initial;
          }
      }
      
    {% endunless %}

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      TYPOGRAPHY CUSTOMIZATION
      =============================================================================
      Dynamic typography settings from theme editor
      - font_weight: Font weight setting from theme editor
      - font_size: Font size setting in pixels
      - section-id-{{ section.id }}: Unique identifier for section-specific styling
    {% endcomment %}
    .section-id-{{ section.id }} {
      font-weight: {{ section.settings.font_weight }};
      font-size: {{ section.settings.font_size }}px;
    }

    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      DESKTOP IMAGE LAYOUT OPTIMIZATION
      =============================================================================
      Desktop-specific image layout adjustments
      - min-width: 768px: Desktop breakpoint
      - image-with-text__image: Image container styling
      - padding: 3rem vertical padding for desktop layout
      - image-with-text__image__inner: Inner image wrapper styling
    {% endcomment %}
    @media(min-width: 768px) {
      .image-with-text__image {
        padding: 3rem 0;
      }
      .section-id-{{ section.id }} .image-with-text__image__inner {
        {% if section.settings.media_size == "cover" %}
          transform: scale({{ section.settings.image_width | times: 0.01 }});
        {% elsif section.settings.media_size == "contain" %}
          height: auto !important;
          width: {{ section.settings.image_width }}% !important;
        {% endif %}
      }

      .section-id-{{ section.id }} .feature-header {
        {%- assign title_size_medium = section.settings.title_size | times: 0.7 -%}
        font-size: {{ title_size_medium }}px;
      }

      .section-id-{{ section.id }} .image-with-text__text {
        flex-basis: {{ section.settings.text_width }}%;
      }

      .section-id-{{ section.id }} .image-with-text__image__inner .rimage-outer-wrapper {
        background-size: {{ section.settings.media_size }};
      }
    }

    @media (min-width: 992px) {
      .section-id-{{ section.id }} .feature-header {
        font-size: {{ section.settings.title_size }}px;
      }
    }

    /* Maintain newlines if specified */
    {%- if title_with_line_breaks != blank and title_with_line_breaks contains '<br />' -%}
      @media (min-width: 375px) {
        .section-id-{{ section.id }} .feature-header {
          white-space: nowrap;
        }
      }
    {%- endif -%}

    /* Styling to allow duplicate mobile-only heading above image */
    .image-with-text__mobile_heading {
      display: none;
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .image-with-text__mobile_heading {
        padding-top: 70px;
        display: block;
        order: 0;
      }
      .image-with-text__mobile_heading + .image-with-text__image {
        padding-top: 0;
      }
      .image-with-text__mobile_heading ~ .image-with-text__text .feature-header,
      .image-with-text__mobile_heading ~ .image-with-text__text .feature-subheader {
        display: none;
      }
    }
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .why-we-made-this .accordion-content {
          padding: 16px 12px;
      }
    }

    /* Bulleted list */
    .image-with-text__bullet .h3 {
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    .image-with-text__bullet .rte > :first-child {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .section-id-{{ section.id }} .image-with-text__bullet {
      {%- if block.settings.custom_bullet_point_icon -%}
        background-image: url('{{ block.settings.custom_bullet_point_icon }}');
      {%- else -%}
        background-image: url('{{ 'icon-checkmark.svg' | asset_url }}');
      {%- endif -%}
      background-position: top left;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-size: 32px 32px;
      min-height: 32px;
      padding-left: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  {% endstyle %}

  {%- if section.settings.wave != "none" -%}
      {%- render 'wave-styles', 
          wave_position: section.settings.wave, 
          section_id: section.id
          fill_color: section.settings.color_bg -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {% if section.settings.title != blank %}
      <h2 class="h2 align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }} desktop">
          {{ title_with_line_breaks }}
      </h2>
  {% endif %}

  {%- if subtitle_with_line_breaks != blank -%}
      <div class="rte align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }} subheading desktop" data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s">
          {{ subtitle_with_line_breaks }}
      </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {% capture image_html %} 
    <div class="image-with-text__image lazyload--placeholder">
      <div class="image-with-text__image__inner">
        {%- if image == blank and video == blank -%}
          <div class="placeholder-image">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag: 'placeholder-svg' }}</div>
        {%- elsif video == blank -%}
          <div class="rimage-outer-wrapper lazyload fade-in"
              data-cc-animate="cc-zoom-out"
              data-bgset="{% render 'bgset', image: image %}"
              data-sizes="auto"
              data-parent-fit="cover"
              style="max-width: {{ image.width }}px; max-height: {{ image.height }}px">
            <div class="rimage-wrapper" style="padding-top:{{ 1 | divided_by: image.aspect_ratio | times: 100 }}%">
              <noscript>
                <img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 1024, height: 1024 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | escape }}" class="rimage__image">
              </noscript>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- else -%}
          {% render 'inline-video', video: video, image: image %}
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      
      {% if section.settings.title != blank %}
        <h2 class="h2 align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }} mobile">
          {{ title_with_line_breaks }}
        </h2>
      {% endif %}

      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <div class="rte align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }} subheading mobile" data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="0.3s">
          {{ subtitle_with_line_breaks }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  {% endcapture %}

  <div class='why-we-made-this_container cf lazy-background
    section-id-{{ section.id }} use-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}-bg
    {% if section.settings.image_width < 100 and section.settings.media_size == "contain" %}section-spacing-sm{% endif %}
    image-with-text--{{ section.settings.media_size }}
  ' id="section-id-{{ section.id }}" data-section-type="image-with-text" data-cc-animate>
      {%- if section.settings.title_above_image_mobile -%}
          <div class="image-with-text__mobile_heading">
              {% if subtitle_with_line_breaks != blank %}
                  <div class="feature-subheader" data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="0.1s">{{ subtitle_with_line_breaks | escape }}</div>
              {% endif %}
          </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {% if section.settings.image_position == 'left' %}{{ image_html }}{% endif %}

      <div class="image-with-text__text align-{{ section.settings.text_alignment }}">
          <div class='image-with-text__text__wrap {% if brightness < 190 and alpha > 0 %}inherit-colors{% endif %}'>
              <!-- FAQ Section -->
              <div class="faq-section" id="faq-section">
                {% for faq in faqs %}
                    <div class="accordion">
                        <div class="accordion-heading" onclick="toggleAccordion(this)" data-image="{{ faq.image | image_url: width: 400 }}">
                            {% if faq.icon != blank %}
                              <span class="img-container">
                                <img 
                                  src="{{ faq.icon | image_url: width: 96 }}" 
                                  alt="{{ faq.title | escape }}"
                                  width="48"
                                  height="48"
                                  loading="lazy"
                                />
                              </span>
                            {% endif %}
                            <p>{{ faq.title }}</p>
                            <span class="plus-minus-icon"></span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="accordion-content">
                          {%- assign toggle_content = faq.content | split: ' | ' -%}
                          <ul>
                            {%- for content in toggle_content -%}
                              <li>{{ content }}</li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                {% endfor %}
              </div>

              <!-- Script to handle accordion toggle -->
              <script>
                  function toggleAccordion(element) {
                    // Close all other accordions
                    $('.accordion > .accordion-heading').not(element).removeClass('active');
                    $('.accordion > .accordion-heading').not(element).next('.accordion-content').slideUp(200);

                    // Toggle the clicked accordion
                    var content = $(element).next('.accordion-content');
                    $(element).toggleClass('active');
                    content.slideToggle(200);

                    // If the clicked accordion is active
                    if ($(element).hasClass('active')) {
                      var image = element.getAttribute('data-image');
                      
                      $('.image-with-text__image__inner').css('background-image', 'url(' + image + ')');
                      $('.image-with-text__image__inner').addClass('toggled');
                      $('.image-with-text__image__inner .video-container').css('display', 'none');
                    } else {
                      // If no other accordion is active, remove the image and display the video
                      if ($('.accordion.active').length === 0) {
                        $('.image-with-text__image__inner').css('background-image', 'none');
                        $('.image-with-text__image__inner').removeClass('toggled');
                        $('.image-with-text__image__inner .video-container').css('display', 'block');
                      }
                    }
                  }
              </script>

              {%- assign bullet_points = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'bullet_point' -%}
              {%- if bullet_points.size > 0 -%}
                  <div class="image-with-text__bullet-list">
                      {%- for block in bullet_points -%}
                          <div class="image-with-text__bullet">
                          <h3 class="h3">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
                          <div class="rte">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
                          </div>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                  </div>
              {%- endif -%}

              {% if section.settings.button_label != blank %}
                  <div class="button-row" data-cc-animate="cc-fade-in-up" data-cc-animate-delay="0.4s">
                      {% if section.settings.button_link != blank %}
                          <a data-cc-animate-click class="
                              {% if section.settings.button_style != 'auto' %}button-custom {% endif %}
                              {% if section.settings.button_arrowless %}button--arrowless{% endif %}
                              {% if section.settings.button_style == 'link' %}link-display {% else %}button {% if section.settings.button_style == 'secondary' %}alt{% endif %}{% endif %}"
                              href="{{ section.settings.button_link }}">
                      {% else %}
                          <span class="
                              {% if section.settings.button_style != 'auto' %}button-custom {% endif %}
                              {% if section.settings.button_arrowless %}button--arrowless{% endif %}
                              {% if section.settings.button_style == 'link' %}link-display {% else %}button {% if section.settings.button_style == 'secondary' %}alt{% endif %}{% endif %}">
                      {% endif %}

                      {{ section.settings.button_label | escape }}

                      {% if section.settings.button_link == blank %}
                          </span>
                      {% else %}
                          </a>
                      {% endif %}
                  </div>
              {% endif %}
          </div>
      </div>

      {% if section.settings.image_position == 'right' %}{{ image_html }}{% endif %}
  </div>
{% endif %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the comprehensive "Why We Made This" section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  This is a complex, dynamic section that integrates with product collection metafields
  to display brand story content, FAQ sections, and customizable media layouts.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - Dynamic content from collection metafields (title, subtitle, video, image, FAQs)
  - Conditional rendering based on metafield availability
  - Interactive FAQ accordion with image switching
  - Responsive design with mobile/desktop optimizations
  - Customizable color schemes and background images
  - Wave divider options for visual separation
  - Bullet point blocks for additional content
  - Video integration with fallback images
  
  **METAFIELD INTEGRATION:**
  - wwmt_section_title: Required title for section display
  - wwmt_default_video: Video content for section
  - wwmt_default_image: Image content for section
  - wwmt_section_subtitle: Optional subtitle content
  - wwmt_fields: FAQ content in rich text format
  
  **LAYOUT OPTIONS:**
  - Image position: Left or right positioning
  - Media size: Cover (fill) or contain (natural) sizing
  - Text width: 30-70% customizable text area width
  - Text alignment: Left, center, or right alignment
  - Mobile title positioning: Above or below image
  
  **STYLING CUSTOMIZATION:**
  - Color schemes: Standard, alternate, or custom colors
  - Typography: Font size (12-24px) and weight (100-900)
  - Background images with parallax effects
  - Wave dividers for visual separation
  - Custom bullet point icons
  
  **INTERACTIVE ELEMENTS:**
  - FAQ accordion with image switching
  - Button styles: Primary, secondary, auto, or link
  - Hover effects and animations
  - Responsive image handling
  - Video playback controls
  
  **RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR:**
  - Mobile-optimized layouts
  - Disabled parallax on mobile for performance
  - Responsive typography scaling
  - Mobile-specific title positioning
  - Touch-friendly accordion interactions
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Why we made this",
  "class": "section-image-with-text why-we-made-this",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Text"
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Why we made this"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "title_above_image_mobile",
      "label": "Show title above image on mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "title_size",
      "min": 16,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 2,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Heading text size",
      "default": 28
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "not_appear_for",
      "label": "Not appear for",
      "info": "Comma separated list of product tags where you don't want to display."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Use this text to share information about your store with your customers. Describe product, share announcements, or welcome customers to your store.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "button_label",
      "label": "Button"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "button_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "button_arrowless",
      "label": "Hide button arrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "text_alignment",
      "label": "Text alignment",
      "default": "center",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Left",
          "value": "left"
        },
        {
          "label": "Center",
          "value": "center"
        },
        {
          "label": "Right",
          "value": "right"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "text_width",
      "min": 30,
      "max": 70,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "%",
      "label": "Text width",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "button_style",
      "label": "Button style",
      "default": "auto",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Button - primary",
          "value": "primary"
        },
        {
          "label": "Button - secondary",
          "value": "secondary"
        },
        {
          "label": "Button - auto",
          "value": "auto"
        },
        {
          "label": "Link",
          "value": "link"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Media"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image",
      "label": "Image",
      "info": "If you're using an mp4 video, it's recommended to also add an image, which will be shown while the video loads"
    },
    {
      "id": "video",
